    "title": "Inflow to a Waste Water Treatment Plant: observations and processed data",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.15301164",
    "publication_date": "2025-04-29",
    "description": "<div>This repository provides access to measurements of the combined sewage inflow to a Waste Water Treatment Plant (WWTP) located in Denmark. The data is accompanied by measurements of relevant metereological variables captured by a weather station near the WWTP and provided by the Danish Metereological Institute (DMI).<br>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>The dataset contains approximately 15 months of hourly observations. The exact location of the WWTP and weather station are omitted.</div>\n<h3>Files</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>README</strong> contains a description of the dataset. <strong><br></strong></li>\n<li><strong>observations</strong> contains all the measurements, split in two files respectively for the flow and metereological data.</li>\n<li><strong>processed</strong> contains the matched data with minimal preprocessing as described <a href=\"https://github.com/DHI/WaterBench-TimeSeries-WWTPINflow/blob/master/code/0_overview.ipynb\">here</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
